## How to Run

1. Download or clone the repository
2. Open the project folder
3. Run `index.html` in any web browser

## Purpose of the Project

The main objective of this project is to create a digital city information portal that helps citizens and visitors access important services, tourism details, and public information easily through a simple and attractive website interface.

